msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Organización"

msgid "Installing OpenJDK 17"
msgstr "Instalar OpenJDK 17"

msgid "Installing Android Studio"
msgstr "Instalar Android Studio"

msgid ""
"While the Mobile Vulkan renderer has many optimizations targeted at mobile "
"devices, we're still working out the kinks. It is highly advisable to use "
"the compatibility renderer (OpenGL) for the time being when targeting "
"Android based XR devices."
msgstr ""
"Si bien el renderizador Mobile Vulkan cuenta con numerosas optimizaciones "
"para dispositivos móviles, aún estamos perfeccionando los detalles. Por el "
"momento, se recomienda usar el renderizador Compatibility (OpenGL) para "
"dispositivos XR basados en Android."

msgid ""
"You can read more about gradle builds here: :ref:`doc_android_gradle_build`."
msgstr ""
"Puedes leer más sobre las compilaciones con Gradle "
"aquí: :ref:`doc_android_gradle_build`."

msgid ""
"The vendors plugin can be downloaded from the Asset Store, search for "
"\"OpenXR vendors\"."
msgstr ""
"El plugin de proveedores se puede descargar desde la tienda de assets. Busca "
"«OpenXR vendors»."

msgid ""
"You will find the installed files inside the ``addons`` folder. "
"Alternatively you can manually install the vendors plugin by downloading it "
"`from the release page here <https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors/"
"releases>`__. You will need to copy the ``assets/addons/godotopenxrvendors`` "
"folder from the zip file into your projects ``addons`` folder."
msgstr ""
"Encontrarás los archivos instalados dentro de la carpeta ``addons``. Como "
"alternativa, puedes instalar manualmente el plugin de proveedores "
"descargándolo `desde la página de versiones <https://github.com/GodotVR/"
"godot_openxr_vendors/releases>`__. Tendrás que copiar la carpeta ``assets/"
"addons/godotopenxrvendors`` del archivo ZIP a la carpeta ``addons`` de tu "
"proyecto."
